OL,3,AHK's Tiananmen activists guilty in
OL,4,Anational security trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FProsecutors argued the defendants
OL,7,F"endanger(ed) national security in the
OL,8,Fname of human rights". Chow, who
OL,9,Frepresented herself, told the court in
OL,10,FMay that the law itself was on trial.
